                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Editorial Note</hi>
                </head>
                <p>The Department of State, on July 23, released two statements by Secretary
                    Marshall dealing with the fighting in northwestern Greece and with the question
                    of an international brigade; for texts, see Department of State <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Bulletin</hi>, August 3, 1947, page 228.</p>
            </div>
